const UNION_BOKI_QUOTES=[
 'You came back wearing someone else’s certainty. I can hear it in every word.',
 'Do not put a crown on my grief and call it your kingdom.',
 'Tajiri is a child, not an inconvenience in your magnificent plan.',
 'You speak of order. All I hear is a door being locked from the outside.',
 'Whatever stands behind you, stranger, it has taught you to sound like a cage.',
 'I searched for one small hand to hold. You would close your fist around the whole world.',
 'These halls remember my sorrow. They will remember the sound of your chains breaking, too.',
 'Do not mistake my tears for surrender. I have already buried enough of my family.',
 'You promise a world without suffering, yet every step you take demands another person kneel.',
 'Tajiri will not grow up beneath your crown. I will tear it from you before it becomes his sky.'
];
